{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions","id":958664,"title":"Two Legacies - Seeking opinions!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-27T03:16:06-07:00","id":958664,"title":"Two Legacies - Seeking opinions!","content":"Well, so I just created 2 Legacies for my players on a mixed game of Chronicles of Darkness where we have 2 Vampires, 2 Mages, 2 Werewolves and 1 Hunter.<br /> So the Mages I designed the Legacies for are:<br /> Ignis, the Mysterium Obrimos with a Spirit Familiar is basically going around meddling with Spirits and Magic, trying to make the world a better place. [Onmyoudou]<br /> Manimemos, the Guardian of the Veil Mastigos is focusing on Life magic to change his body, like becoming other people and making gross manipulation of its body (clawed three limb beast with 100 eyes being his goal). [Yee Naagloshii]<br /> <br /> Opinions, criticism, changes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T03:17:58-07:00","id":958665,"title":"","content":"Yee Naagloshii<br /> (shifters)<br /> <br /> Origins<br /> Parentage: Mastigos, Guardians of the Veil.<br /> Background: The original Naagloshii were more akin to Demons than Humans. Capable of shifting forms, they were able to infiltrate human settlements and consume them from within. In time, the name was passed down to a sect of Native American tribal Willworkers who used the Arcana of Life and Mind to emulate their inner Demons to better understand and defeat them. Founded by Mastigoi Mages focused on the mastery of the Self (both Physical and Mental), it evolved into a Legacy of transformation and adaptation, to environments both wild and urban.<br /> Appearance: Shifters usually dress themselves in subdued colors, the better to avoid attention. Some, the more traditionalists, will adorn their bodies with tribal markings or use some sort of tribal adornments.<br /> <br /> Doctrine<br /> Prerequisites: Gnosis 2, Life 2, Mind 2, Medicine 2, Empathy 2.<br /> Initiation: A prospective Yee Naagloshii must prove their aptitude with both their Inner and Outer selves before they are allowed to know the secrets of the Legacy. This usually takes the form of a ritualistic combat occurring simultaneously in the Fallen World and the Astral Planes.<br /> <br /> Magic<br /> Ruling Arcanum: Life<br /> Yantras: Blood (freshly drawn from oneself inflicting 1 point of Bashing damage, +1); Totem (+1); Breaking a finger (inflicting 1 point of Lethal damage, +2); Eating raw flesh (+1); Tasting the blood of the target of a Spell (+2).<br /> Oblations: Stalking a target; ritually killing an animal; studying a mark; exercising the body or mind; meditating on one\u2019s breathing rhythm.<br /> <br /> Attainments<br /> First: Purity of Two Forms<br /> Prerequisites: Initiation<br /> The first thing a Shifter learns is how to control its body. By replicating the effects of the Spell \u201cCleanse the Body\u201d, a Shifter can better survive in inhospitable conditions by scavenging without having to worry about poisons and toxins.<br /> Optional: Mind 1<br /> Knowing is an important tool. Being able to recall details can sometimes mean the difference between life and death, or between a perfect disguise or a flawed attempt. This reproduces the effects of the \u201cPerfect Recall\u201d Spell.<br /> <br /> Second: The Hunter\u2019s Gait<br /> Prerequisites: Gnosis 2, Life 2, Medicine 3<br /> Focusing one\u2019s control over its physical form, a Naagloshii can spend a scene meditating to regulate its breathing, heartbeat, metabolism, reflexes, scent and even regeneration as per the effects of \u201cBody Control\u201d with Advanced Duration.<br /> Optional: Mind 2<br /> Another application of the Hunter\u2019s Gait is the ability to move unseen\u2026 or rather, \u201cunfelt\u201d. At the end of the scene of meditation a Shifter can move through crowds without fear of recognition, as if under the effect of the Spell \u201cIncognito Presence\u201d with reach applied to Advanced Duration.<br /> <br /> Third: Another Self<br /> Prerequisites: Gnosis 4, Life 3. Medicine 3, Empathy 3<br /> To a Shifter one\u2019s body is as readily malleable as clay. As per the Spell \u201cMany Faces\u201d a Shifter can alter its own body as it wishes, gaining the ability to shift its Physical Attributes and/or its physical traits (height, weight, sex, hair color, skin tone, etc.). If the Naagloshii tastes the blood of a subject, it can faithfully copy its physical appearance.<br /> Optional: Mind 3<br /> Once a Naagloshii has taken a bit of the essence of a mark it can reproduce the target\u2019s mentality more faithfully. This gives access to the memories as if the Spell \u201cRead the Depths\u201d has been cast on the target.<br /> <br /> Fourth: Shifting Forms<br /> Prerequisites: Gnosis 6, Life 4, Medicine 4, Empathy 3.<br /> Cleansing one\u2019s body. Controling it. Changing its form. All of these skills lead to the ability to reshape itself. While not yet inherently able to Shapeshift like the Demons of yore, a Naagloshii can now adapt by giving itself new characteristics as by the effects of the Spell \u201cTransform Life\u201d with Advanced Duration.<br /> Optional: Mind 4<br /> The ability to gain the characteristics of another being is of no use if one does not have the Skills to better use it. And so, as the Naagloshii can shift the form of its body it can also reshape its Mind reproducing the effects of the \u201cGain Skill\u201d Spell.<br /> <br /> Fifth: Skin-Walker<br /> Prerequisites: Gnosis 8, Life 5, Medicine 4, Empathy 4.<br /> Finally in touch with its inner Demons and able to form its body to reflect such, the pinnacle of a Naagloshii\u2019s ability is reflected by the \u201cShapechanging\u201d Spell with reach dedicated to Instant Casting and to retain consciousness without risk of losing oneself to the mind of the new shape.<br /> Optional: Mind 5<br /> The Mind of a Naagloshii is as mutable as its body and can be made to expand to fulfill whatever task it sets itself upon. This Attainment reproduces the effects of the Spell \u201cAugment Mind\u201d with Reach applied to Instant Casting, and two more Attributes","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T03:23:47-07:00","id":958667,"title":"","content":"Onmy\u014dd\u014d<br /> <br /> Origins<br /> Parentage: Obrimos, Adamantine Arrow or Mysterium.<br /> Background: Originating from Japan, this Legacy focused on the averting the many dangers that endangered the country and the Emperor, as well as recording the passing of time, studying the natural world and astronomy. Many centuries later, the Legacy has spread throughout the whole world, still clinging to its ancestral trappings and mystical symbology of Yin-Yang and the Five Elements, keeping alive their mission to protect the Fallen World from the Shadow, recording and cataloging the inhabitants of the Shadow.<br /> <br /> Appearance: Onmyouji come from different walks of life but most have had some sort of interaction with Eastern Occultism. Most Onmyouji will carry with them F\u016bda, Mala, the Tai-Chi or a pentagram representing the Five Elements.<br /> <br /> Doctrine<br /> Prerequisites: Spirit 2, Academics 1, Crafts 1, Occult 2 and Sciences 1.<br /> Initiation: The prospective Onmyouji must pass three tests which will quiz him on his knowledge about Spirits, the way of Yin-Yang, the Five Elements and the natural world.<br /> <br /> Magic<br /> Ruling Arcanum: Spirit<br /> Yantras: Reciting a Mantra relevant to the Spell (instant action, +2); using a mala (+1); using a f\u016bda with a relevant prayer as a focus (+1, +2 if the f\u016bda is burnt); using a Mudra relevant to the Spell (+1); wearing traditional Onmyouji vestments (+1);<br /> Oblations: Chanting the Mantras while sitting seiza; preparing f\u016bda; exorcising a place/person; finding constellations; writing down information about the Shadow.<br /> <br /> Attainments<br /> First: Lifting the Veil<br /> Prerequisites: Initiation<br /> To be able to deal with Spirits, one must first be able to see them. This Attainment reproduces the effects of the Spell \u201cExorcist\u2019s Eye\u201d becoming able to see their presence in the Fallen World. Optional: Prime 1<br /> The Mage may also become aware of spiritual Loci as per the effects of the Spell \u201cSacred Geometry\u201d.<br /> <br /> Second: Sensing the Currents<br /> Prerequisites: Spirit 2, Occult 3<br /> By looking at a Spirit, the Mage can easily glean information about it, making it easier to command, subdue or parlay with. This reproduces the Spell \u201cKnow Spirit\u201d, allowing for as much information as the Mage\u2019s Spirit dots.<br /> Optional: Prime 2<br /> Oft times the Onmyouji will find themselves facing other willworkers or the results of their art. This replicates the effects of the Spell \u201cSupernal Vision\u201d with Reach assigned to Instant Casting and sensing the nature of other Supernaturals.<br /> <br /> Third: Raising the Walls<br /> Prerequisites: Spirit 3. In addition to the Occult 3 requirement from the previous Attainment, the Onmyouji must increase the other Skills she used to meet the requirements of the Legacy to 2.<br /> To protect the Fallen World means protecting its people and places from the influence of the Shadow. An Onmyouji is well aware of that fact and as such Barriers are of second nature to her. By carefully redoing the Feng Shui of a room or building, or reciting the correct mantras and endowing the correct talismans upon a person, an Onmyouji can assure that no Spirit Magic can be cast within its Kekkai. This duplicates the Spell \u201cEphemeral Shield\u201d with Reach dedicated against Spirit\u2019s physical attacks and Advanced Duration.<br /> Optional: Prime 3<br /> Sometimes, more worrisome than the powers of the Shadow is the powers of other practitioners. This replicates the effect of the \u201cWards and Signs\u201d Prime Spell with reach assigned to Advanced Duration and Advanced Potency.<br /> <br /> Fourth: Undoing the Bindings<br /> Prerequisites: Spirit 4, Occult 4 and the other Skill requirements of the previous Attainment.<br /> Sometimes a Spirit on this side of the Gauntlet is but a nuisance. Other times they may prove themselves troublesome or even perilous. It is up to the Onmyouji to undo the harm that they wreath unto the world. By spending a scene in ritual, writing f\u016bdas and aligning the Feng Shui of the room an Onmyouji can protect it from Spirits by making it so that they cannot Manifest. This replicates the effects of the \u201cErode Resonance\u201d Spell with reach applied to Advanced Duration.<br /> Optional: Prime 4<br /> A wise Onmyouji knows that spells can be as much of a problem as Spirits, and as such must be prepared to undo curses laid upon the people. With enough preparation and time, even the mightiest curses can be laid bare. This attainment works as the Spell \u201cDispel Magic\u201d with reach dedicated to making the dispelation Lasting.<br /> <br /> Fifth: F\u016bda<br /> Prerequisites: Spirit 5. In addition to the Occult 4 requirement from the previous Attainment, the Onmyouji must increase the other Skills to 3.<br /> Sometimes the Spirits cannot be appeased, or they cannot be simply banished. When one of the inhabitants of the Shadow becomes too unruly, it\u2019s up to the Onmyouji to get rid of it by any means. The mark of a Yin-Yang Master is to take the bad and turn it into good. By the means of this Attainment an Onmyouji can take the remnants of a Spirit it has subdued and craft a Fetish for future use. These usually take the form of F\u016bda that allow the Onmyouji access to some of the Spirit\u2019s Influences, as per the Spell \u201cCraft Fetish\u201d with Advanced Duration.<br /> Optional: Prime 5<br /> Additionally, a skilled Onmyouji knows when to store and when to release the powers of a Spirit in a Fetish into a more useable form. By taking measures to create a suitable form out of the energies of the World, the Onmyouji creates a construct which a Spirit may inhabit by placing its Fetish inside, as per the Spell \u201cCreate Eidolon\u201d with reach assigned to Advanced Duration.<br /> <br /> Also, a Merit adapted from the Lu Merit of the Taoist from Magical Traditions<br /> <br /> Merit: Senji Ryakketsu (\u25cf to \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf)<br /> Prerequisites: Onmyouji \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf, Occult \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf, Academics \u25cf\u25cf<br /> Oft times the Onmyouji might be faced with situations to which she wasn\u2019t able to properly prepare. An Onmyouji with access to the Summary to Judgements of Divinations is able to summon a Shikigami, a small Spirit that can perform one single task. The amount of Spirits in the copy of the Senji Ryakketsu, their maximum Rank and the complexity of the tasks they can perform are related to the dots in the merit, as follows:<br /> <br /> Dots N\u00ba of Spirits Rank Complexity of Task<br /> \u25cf 2 \u25cf Doesn\u2019t require Dots on a Skill;<br /> \u25cf\u25cf 5<br /> \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf 9 \u25cf\u25cf Requires one Dot on a Skill<br /> \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf 18<br /> \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf\u25cf 36 \u25cf\u25cf\u25cf Requires up to three Dots on a Skill;<br /> The Storyteller decides what services an Onmyouji can obtain from the Senji Ryakketsu. Typical feats for the greater Shikigami include luck, protection from various hazards or curing disease.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T04:56:01-07:00","id":958692,"title":"","content":"On first sight they seem quite good. I may have to look the spells up to see if Reach adds up, but otherwise I would consider you did a great job.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i><b>I</b>'m <b>S</b>o <b>M</b>eta <b>E</b>ven <b>T</b>his <b>A</b>cronym</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/195-thorbes","name":"Thorbes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar195_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2982"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T10:10:26-07:00","id":958783,"title":"","content":"It would help if you specified when you spend Reach on Instant Casting and when the Attainment is supposed to take time. Your write-up would be much clearer that way.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HTaiji</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958667#post958667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Optional: Prime 3<br /> Sometimes, more worrisome than the powers of the Shadow is the powers of other practitioners. This replicates the effect of the \u201cWards and Signs\u201d Prime Spell with reach assigned to Advanced Duration and Advanced Potency.</div> </div> </div> </div>Advanced Potency only helps against Dispellation. Attainments are already immune to it, so you can spend the Reach on something else.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HTaiji</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958667#post958667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fourth: Undoing the Bindings<br /> Prerequisites: Spirit 4, Occult 4 and the other Skill requirements of the previous Attainment.<br /> Sometimes a Spirit on this side of the Gauntlet is but a nuisance. Other times they may prove themselves troublesome or even perilous. It is up to the Onmyouji to undo the harm that they wreath unto the world. By spending a scene in ritual, writing f\u016bdas and aligning the Feng Shui of the room an Onmyouji can protect it from Spirits by making it so that they cannot Manifest. This replicates the effects of the \u201cErode Resonance\u201d Spell with reach applied to Advanced Duration.</div> </div> </div> </div>Erode Resonance is Lasting by default, so Advanced Duration is not necessary. That gives you two Reach to spend.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HTaiji</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958667#post958667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Optional: Prime 4<br /> A wise Onmyouji knows that spells can be as much of a problem as Spirits, and as such must be prepared to undo curses laid upon the people. With enough preparation and time, even the mightiest curses can be laid bare. This attainment works as the Spell \u201cDispel Magic\u201d with reach dedicated to making the dispelation Lasting.</div> </div> </div> </div>This Attainment gives you four Reach and Lasting duration only needs two Reach. It will probably only work on Arcana the character knows, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T16:33:59-07:00","id":958950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958783#post958783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It would help if you specified when you spend Reach on Instant Casting and when the Attainment is supposed to take time. Your write-up would be much clearer that way.</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed, I'll write it down.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958783#post958783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Advanced Potency only helps against Dispellation. Attainments are already immune to it, so you can spend the Reach on something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>Removed the Advanced Potency, although since no other Reach option would work, I decided to leave it without the 2nd Reach effect (still thought about giving it Indefinite duration, but it's a bit overkill to have a place/person protected against direct Spells forever... also, since the Spirit part is not Indefinite duration it didn't seem fair making the Prime part Indefinite)<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958783#post958783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Erode Resonance is Lasting by default, so Advanced Duration is not necessary. That gives you two Reach to spend.</div> </div> </div> </div>Decided to put Reach into penalizing future attempts and Advanced Duration to apply to the other Reach effect.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Teatime</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958783#post958783\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This Attainment gives you four Reach and Lasting duration only needs two Reach. It will probably only work on Arcana the character knows, though.</div> </div> </div> </div>Decided to change the Spell to Supernal Dispelation with Reach used for Advanced Duration.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11807-htaiji","name":"HTaiji","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"50"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T16:48:40-07:00","id":958957,"title":"","content":"Don't forget that you can treat attainments as combined spells from 3rd attainment on. That might give you some uses for your Reach.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T01:21:04-07:00","id":959145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958957#post958957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't forget that you can treat attainments as combined spells from 3rd attainment on. That might give you some uses for your Reach.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait, really? That's news to me, where is it mentioned?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T04:45:26-07:00","id":959175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>HTaiji</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=958950#post958950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Removed the Advanced Potency, although since no other Reach option would work, I decided to leave it without the 2nd Reach effect (still thought about giving it Indefinite duration, but it's a bit overkill to have a place/person protected against direct Spells forever... also, since the Spirit part is not Indefinite duration it didn't seem fair making the Prime part Indefinite)</div> </div> </div> </div>You could apply Advanced Scale, so it could cover an entire house. As of now, you could cover a single room at best. For symmetry, you could apply Advanced Scale to the Spirit Attainment as well. You would probably have to forgo protection from physical attacks, but it might be more appropriate - Feng Shui is subtle, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T05:50:56-07:00","id":959189,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=959145#post959145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, really? That's news to me, where is it mentioned?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not outright stated so much as implied. If you go look at the 11thQ writeup in the pdf you'll see that the 5th Optional Matter attainment is a Master level effect and uses too many Reach its effects being Instantaneous and at Sensory Range. However, if it's activated as a combined effect with the first part of the attainment you can see that actually the activation takes 1 scene of meditation which brings the Reach back down to an amount that agrees with the rules. It may also explain why factors are limited to the lesser of Time or Matter (Though that's pretty much redundant since obviously they both have to be at 5) instead of just Matter.<br /> <br /> It also makes sense considering that spells can be combined after Gnosis 3 and attainments are in many ways very similar to and in fact modeled off of spells.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-28T06:04:21-07:00","id":959193,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/958664-two-legacies-seeking-opinions?p=959189#post959189\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's not outright stated so much as implied. If you go look at the 11thQ writeup in the pdf you'll see that the 5th Optional Matter attainment is a Master level effect and uses too many Reach its effects being Instantaneous and at Sensory Range. However, if it's activated as a combined effect with the first part of the attainment you can see that actually the activation takes 1 scene of meditation which brings the Reach back down to an amount that agrees with the rules. It may also explain why factors are limited to the lesser of Time or Matter (Though that's pretty much redundant since obviously they both have to be at 5) instead of just Matter.<br /> <br /> It also makes sense considering that spells can be combined after Gnosis 3 and attainments are in many ways very similar to and in fact modeled off of spells.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, thanks for the clarification.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5973-prometheus","name":"Prometheus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5973_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}